WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:04.604
&gt;&gt; FARTHER SOUTH, THERE ARE NO
SOUTH SCIENCE OF RUSSIA'S

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.973
RELENTLESS ATTACKS ON THE CITY
OF MYKOLAIV.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:11.544
THE MAYOR SAYS THE CITY TOOK A
POUNDING AGAIN WEDNESDAY

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:14.581
MORNING, THIS TIME HE SAYS THAT
RUSSIA LAUNCHED AIR STRIKES

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.315
WHICH DESTROYED THE
SUPERMARKET.

00:00:16.315 --> 00:00:19.819
AND CAUSED A FIRE ELSEWHERE IN
THE CITY.

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:23.923
MYKOLAIV IS A STRATEGICALLY
IMPORTANT CITY NEAR THE FRONT

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:27.560
LINES IN THE SOUTH.
AND IT STRUCK ALMOST EVERY

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.062
SINGLE NIGHT FOR THE LAST
MONTH.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:32.799
UKRAINE ALSO SAYS ITS FORCES
ARE MAKING SLOW, BUT SAID THE

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.869
PROCESS IN THE SOUTH.
UKRAINIAN OFFICIALS SAY THAT

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.972
RUSSIAN TROOPS HAVE BEEN PUSHED
OUT OF SOME VILLAGES, AND

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:42.075
STRATEGIC POINTS IN THE REGION.
BUT AS NICK ROBERTSON FINDS OUT,

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.611
THE PEOPLE WHO USED TO LIVE
THERE ARE NOT COMING BACK YET.

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:48.815
&gt;&gt; [NOISE] THE ROAD TO --
ISN'T SAFE.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:52.185
PLAYBOY, HIS WAR NAME, IS
TAKING US THERE ACROSS COUNTRY.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:58.124
HE SAYS HIS FORCES RECAPTURED
IT FROM THE RUSSIANS FOLLOWING

00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.694
A TWO-WEEK ARTILLERY BATTLE.
[SPEAKING FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:09.669
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS A MONTH AGO.
IT IS STILL DESERTED, ONLY

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.538
ABANDONED PETS AND FARMYARD
ANIMALS HERE NOW.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:17.443
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU COME IN HERE AND
YOU LOOK AT THE FARM HERE, THE

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:22.282
ANIMALS LEFT OUT, THE DOG IN A
TERRIBLE STATE.

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:25.618
HOW DO YOU FEEL?
&gt;&gt; I FEEL QUITE SAD.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.221
&gt;&gt; AND WHEN CAN PEOPLE COME
BACK TO THIS VILLAGE?

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:33.659
&gt;&gt; I THINK WHEN WE WILL GO
FURTHER FORWARD.

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:36.862
&gt;&gt; FURTHER TO THE NEXT LINE OF
VILLAGERS.

00:01:36.862 --> 00:01:45.371
&gt;&gt; UNEXPLODED SHELLS LATER THE
GROUND, THE END OF WAR A LONG

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.840
WAYS OFF, HE SAYS.
&gt;&gt; I THINK IT'S NOT REAL

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:52.312
FINISHED VERY FAST BECAUSE WE
ARE NOT SO ON THERE RIGHT NOW.

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:59.385
&gt;&gt; DURING THE ATTACK, UKRAINIAN
FORCES ESTIMATE THEY KILLED

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:00.987
ABOUT 50 RUSSIAN SOLDIERS.
INJURED ABOUT 100 MORE.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:06.759
THE BIG CHALLENGE FOR THE
UKRAINIANS NOW, MUSTERING

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.228
ENOUGH MAN TO ADVANCE FURTHER.
THE FRONTLINE IS JUST A FEW

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:09.762
KILOMETERS AWAY, A SINGLE
ARTILLERY SHELL HITS ITS

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:19.405
TARGET.
THE TROOPS THAT TOOK THIS PLACE

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:22.308
LAST MONTH, HAVE MOVED ON.
&gt;&gt; WE ARE PLANNING TO MOVE

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.142
FORWARD.
SHORTLY.

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:25.044
&gt;&gt; WHEN?
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHS]

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.247
I DON'T KNOW.
FROM MY OWN OPINION, I THINK IN

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:32.118
A MONTH.
&gt;&gt; AT THE VILLAGE SCHOOL, WITH

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:33.853
THE SMASHED, CROSS ROOMS
TRASHED.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:42.028
EMPTY BAGS ON THE FLOOR.
AND THE MESSAGE SCRAWLED BEFORE

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:45.598
THEY WERE TREATED.
THE RUSSIAN TROOPS HAVE LEFT A

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.869
PARTING MESSAGE, IT SAYS RUSSIA
IS EVERYWHERE!

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:54.307
IT HAS NO BORDERS.
AND OVER HERE, THEY HAVE

00:02:54.307 --> 00:03:01.514
CROSSED OUT THE UKRAINIAN WORLD
FOR MARCH, AND SAID USE THE

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.949
RIGHT LANGUAGE.
WHEN RUSHERS A PEER TO FIGHT

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.350
HARDER IN TRENCHES AROUND THE
VILLAGE.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:10.323
TANKS TAKEN UP BY ARTILLERY.
YOU GET AN IDEA OF THE FEROCITY

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:14.360
OF THE FIGHT HERE FROM THE
ARTILLERY IMPACTS, AND THE WAY

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.162
THAT THE TREES AROUND HERE ARE
ALL SHREDDED.

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:19.699
BUT HERE IS A SURPRISE.
HITTING THESE TARGETS WITH U.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:23.236
S. GIFTED ARTILLERY WAS NOT AS
EASY AS THE SOLDIERS EXPECTED.

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:33.946
&gt;&gt; IT SHOOTS QUITE GOOD.
BUT, NOT SO GOOD AS WE

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:35.281
EXPECTED.
&gt;&gt; NOT UNGRATEFUL, HE SAYS.

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.883
AND VERY WILLING TO LEARN VERY
BETTER SKILLS.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:48.328
NIC ROBERTSON, CNN, UKRAINE.
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE OFFICIALS ARE

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:50.797
DISMISSING SUGGESTIONS BY
FORMER GERMAN CHANCELLOR THAT

00:03:50.797 --> 00:03:54.033
MOSCOW WANTS A NEGOTIATED
SOLUTION TO THE WAR IN UKRAINE.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:59.105
FORMER CHANCELLOR MADE THEIR
MARK ON WEDNESDAY, AFTER

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:01.874
MEETING LAST WEEK IN MOSCOW
WITH THE RUSSIAN LEADER.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:06.145
HE CITED THE RECENT RAIN DEAL
AS POSSIBLE STARTING POINT

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:09.215
TOWARDS A CEASE-FIRE, BUT
SCHROEDER HAS HAD MOST TIES TO

00:04:09.215 --> 00:04:12.785
VLADIMIR PUTIN FOR MANY YEARS,
AND HIS COMMENTS DID NOT SIT

00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:18.224
WELL IN KYIV, TAKE A LISTEN.
&gt;&gt; [INTERPRETER]

00:04:18.224 --> 00:04:22.095
IT IS SIMPLY DISGUSTING ONE
FORMER LEADERS OF MAJOR STATES

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:26.165
WITH EUROPEAN VALUES WORK FOR
RUSSIA, WHICH IS AT WAR AGAINST

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:30.670
THESE VALUES.
[END OF TRANSLATION]

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.406
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE'S FOREIGN MINISTER
SAYS MOSCOW REMAINS FOCUSED ON

00:04:33.406 --> 00:04:35.808
ITS MILITARY OBJECTIVES IN
UKRAINE AND THAT EVERYTHING

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.877
ELSE IS A SMOKESCREEN.

